ag\" >Take an hour or two off</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend some time fishing, pet a chicken, build a windmill, enjoy the small things in life. Cheaphaven features a brief respite full of farming, building and upgrading, a small town of NPCs for all your chatting and shopping needs, and vaguely humorous descriptions for everyday items. Day/night cycle, market values, sales reputation, a pigeon, all the things that are supposed to be in a farming game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo limitations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo allows you to play for a full in-game week without restrictions. You can keep playing after the demo time ends, but progression won't be possible. Demo save data can be transferred to the full release</p>","developers":["Combo Routine"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707850/header.jpg?t=1751317284","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1707850/394645/bf2c671b428ce390a8a6acf398dc4140f291d2db/1751022076/dash_av1.mpd?t=1658512171","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1707850/394645/bf2c671b428ce390a8a6acf398dc4140f291d2db/1751022076/dash_h264.mpd?t=1658512171","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1707850/394645/bf2c671b428ce390a8a6acf398dc4140f291d2db/1751022076/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1658512171","id":256847825,"name":"Release trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256847825/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1658512171"}],"name":"Cheaphaven","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","